      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791551546533,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROVISIONING\n\nHelm installs ingress-nginx; chart Service is disabled.\nIngress/hubble-ui defines routing and the TLS Secret.\nThe runbook supplies Service/hubble-ui-tailscale.\nTailscale operator advertises its VIP through lab-ingress.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "box-21",
      "originalText": "PROVISIONING\n\nHelm installs ingress-nginx; chart Service is disabled.\nIngress/hubble-ui defines routing and the TLS Secret.\nThe runbook supplies Service/hubble-ui-tailscale.\nTailscale operator advertises its VIP through lab-ingress.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s80qA8tXupYsy1sy7JxpK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
